{"id":"qzqelzdlk1hfkwc73vzg8g7db","title":"航空公司 JetBlue 推出新国内头等舱座位以恢复盈利","originalTitle":"JetBlue unveils new first-class seats to bring back profits","summary":"航空公司 JetBlue 计划于 11 月 12 日推出新国内头等舱座位 BlueFirst，旨在通过更舒适的座位提升盈利。BlueFirst 不同于长途国际航班的 Mint 业务舱，将提供给佛罗里达和加勒比地区的热门航线。截至 11 月 11 日，JetBlue 股价本月已上涨 40%，公司流动性为 22 亿美元。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"CNBC Top News"},"links":{"original":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/11/jetblue-ceo-premium.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T15:00:02.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T15:27:45.932Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T15:27:45.932Z","category":"stock-us","tags":["财报","破产清算"],"score":31,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"earnings","name":"财报"},{"slug":"bankruptcy","name":"破产与清算"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}